[00:00.00]披风 - 陈奕迅 (Eason Chan)
[00:02.27]词：易家扬
[00:04.55]曲：Jerald Chan/MJ
[00:06.82]编曲：Jerald Chan
[00:09.10]监制：Jerald Chan
